<figure class="footing">
  <div class="poses">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="footing-a-title footing-a-desc">
      <title id="footing-a-title">身体向前，落地的脚留在原处</title>
      <desc id="footing-a-desc">浅色虚线是移动前的身体和腿，深色实线是前移后的姿态。两条腿的末端落在同一个地面点。</desc>
      <path d="M24 190H296" stroke="#a9b9ad" fill="none" />
      <rect x="48" y="48" width="148" height="60" rx="28" fill="none" stroke="#81988b" stroke-dasharray="5 5" />
      <path d="m142 104 10 40 24 43" stroke="#81988b" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="5 5" fill="none" />
      <rect x="85" y="48" width="148" height="60" rx="28" fill="#c4a17c" />
      <path d="m180 104 25 42-29 41" stroke="#75593e" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
      <circle cx="205" cy="146" r="5" fill="#f3f2eb" stroke="#75593e" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M165 188h22" stroke="#006a5b" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <path d="M124 28h67m-9-7 9 7-9 7" stroke="#006a5b" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
      <text x="176" y="217" text-anchor="middle">同一个落脚点</text>
    </svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="footing-b-title footing-b-desc">
      <title id="footing-b-title">身体降低时，腿弯向脚掌</title>
      <desc id="footing-b-desc">虚线身体位置较高，实线身体位置较低。腿弯曲后，脚掌仍贴着地面。</desc>
      <path d="M24 190H296" stroke="#a9b9ad" fill="none" />
      <rect x="69" y="48" width="148" height="60" rx="28" fill="none" stroke="#81988b" stroke-dasharray="5 5" />
      <path d="m176 104 27 42-27 41" stroke="#81988b" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="5 5" fill="none" />
      <rect x="69" y="94" width="148" height="60" rx="28" fill="#c4a17c" />
      <path d="m176 149 46 17-46 21" stroke="#75593e" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
      <circle cx="222" cy="166" r="5" fill="#f3f2eb" stroke="#75593e" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M165 188h22" stroke="#006a5b" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <path d="M260 64v66m-7-9 7 9 7-9" stroke="#006a5b" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
      <text x="176" y="217" text-anchor="middle">屈腿，脚掌贴地</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>落脚与屈腿示意，省略了其他关节。动画先确定脚的位置，再用两段骨骼求出肘部或后腿关节的弯曲角度。</figcaption>
</figure>

